{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112060029519-1112_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261112071506\"/><p>黃仁勳捲入婚外情風波。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>美國傳媒當地周三（11）再引述消息指，英偉達始創人兼行政總裁黃仁勳疑與另一名公司女高層有婚外情，是他近日被揭露的第二段婚外情。報道指，董事會正準備罷免黃仁勳，準備最快周三召開會議，決定他的未來去向。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:26:02.538334+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T22:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:26.973191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:26.973191+00:00","content_hash":"9e01383d6386a607fa39af45942a209079343d69ad12f0d1bec836d5724414b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}